@AutoServicePro.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5271

### List vehicles
GET {{AutoServicePro.API_HostAddress}}/api/Vehicles
Accept: application/json

###

### List spare parts
GET {{AutoServicePro.API_HostAddress}}/api/SpareParts
Accept: application/json

###

### List work orders
GET {{AutoServicePro.API_HostAddress}}/api/WorkOrders
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a work order (replace 1 with an existing ID)
GET {{AutoServicePro.API_HostAddress}}/api/WorkOrders/1
Accept: application/json